Package: libmusiccast0
Architecture: any
Multi-Arch: same
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, ${shlibs:Depends}
Description: Yamaha MusicCast device control library and mcctl CLI
 Shared library for discovering and controlling Yamaha MusicCast
 speakers and receivers over the local network (YXC HTTP API).
 .
 This package also installs mcctl, a small command-line tool for
 discovery, status queries, zone power/volume/mute, and Net/USB presets.

